	(text "V22: 10.5 V nominal bias READY, push-pull -> U303 IN+; R310 at receiver.\nLT3013 PWRGD is diagnostic only; no connection to this READY net.\nCold-start minimum blanking 0.5 ms; brownout/maximum delay, energy, PCB and thermal qualification OPEN.\nC307: 1 nF 5% C0G, C0603C102J5GACTU. No energization release."
